  "material_findings": [
    "Actual17437 source is v1, not v2; no endpoint migration performed.",
    "v1 runtime receipt currently lacks condition/rule/source hashes and declaring CID/RID; explicit provenance reconstruction is required before role support can trust it.",
    "v2 has selected source-target closure provenance; add exact schema/rule hash and bind to its actual resolved receipt without replacing its canonical owner semantics.",
    "v1 frozen_entity_relation currently uses raw actual-owner typed equality; v2 uses canonical same-entity comparison. Their behavior must not be silently merged.",
    "Own owner-map wanted inventory currently includes own v2 guard endpoints but not arbitrary v1 support endpoints; new manually mapped existing endpoints need exact validation.",
    "1255/1258 action-versus-relational_action taxonomy is separate from the ownership-support mechanism; do not duplicate E or auto-broaden prefixes.",
    "Pure relation positive fields require honest direct guard support units; a direct-fact-covered-field-only exception would leave the general problem unresolved."
  ],
